        ["Models and config", "ConvNEAT: nodes are single-channel maps at a resolution level; connections are k x k kernels (k in {1, 3, 5}) with derived resample-then-conv; fixed GAP + linear head. Trained by backprop each generation (Lamarckian) through a PropNEAT-style masked layer engine, minibatch Adam lr 0.01, batch 128. Population 30. Synthetic 60 generations x 2 epochs; digits 3 vs 8 40 x 5; digits 10-class 60 x 5; MNIST 40 x 2. Penalty λ = 0.001 and 0.005, seeds 0 to 2 (digits 10-class and MNIST 10-class: λ = 0.001, seeds 0 and 1; MNIST 3 vs 8 λ = 0.005: seed 0 only). Device MPS."],
